{
  "name": "Pocket Apocalypse",
  "comment": "Scythe (Erik Alm, 2003) episode 1, levels 1-10 (+ fSCYTHE.WAD fixes) with the Ashes 2063 setup: weapons, human enemies, items, props, gore, fog, overlay HUD; every wall and floor (Scythe's own too) is an Ashes texture, switches are Ashes walls with Ashes switch panels by what they do (access keypad = door, call box = lift, lever = exit). Weapons come one at a time: revolver + autoloader 1, lever-action 3, pump 4, modular rifle + machine pistol 5, Thumper 6, hunter shotgun 7, military rifle 8, Bolt-Caster 9, battle rifle 10. Explosive barrels are Ashes' radioactive barrel. Keys: 2 pistols, 3 shotguns, 4 SMGs (machine pistol, modular rifle), 6 rifles (military, battle; own 5.56 ammo), 7 Bolt-Caster. Extra medkits, 9mm boxes and rifle ammo are laid beside existing pickups (add_things). Personal use only.",
  "iwad": "~/Library/Application Support/gzdoom/DOOM2.WAD",
